					<ProtectedString name="Source">--[[

To change the decal on the map that shows, open up Main in the explorer menu and select Map. In the properties, look for where it says &apos;Image&apos;.

It should currently say &apos;http://www.roblox.com/asset/?id=&apos;

To put your decal in, just copy and paste the Decal&apos;s ID into the end of the Url.

http://www.roblox.com/asset/?id=YOUR_DECAL_ID_HERE

Don&apos;t remove this script. It is vital. ._.

--]]

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

local function showMap(GUI)
&#9;script.Parent.Show.Visible = false
&#9;script.Parent.Main.Visible = true
end

local function hideMap(GUI)
&#9;script.Parent.Main.Visible = false
&#9;script.Parent.Show.Visible = true
end

script.Parent.Show.MouseButton1Click:connect(showMap)
script.Parent.Main.Hide.MouseButton1Click:connect(hideMap)
</ProtectedString>
